+      (stageLoss Mcap Bs ε k) κ Z η₀ Q degree S Cp:=
+    positiveAt_transport (α:=α) M H hH W bslot _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ κ Z
+      _ _ _ _ _ _ _ η₀ Q degree degree S S Cp Cp hold.1.le
