+  intro e Lslot κ η₀ Q K he hK hlow θ w σ freq t height hw hwL hσlo hσhi hheight hfreq hκ
+    s hQ hslo hs W₁ W₂ hs₁ hs₂ X₁ X₂ hX₁ hX₂ hlarge hcap
