+/- Prepared rational floor-row estimates; compilation and replay are separate. -/
+import OAI.BelowSevenEighthsTight.RetunedAuxiliaryMargins
+import OAI.BelowSevenEighthsTight.RetunedCubeSlotExponent
+import OAI.BelowSevenEighthsTight.RetunedRayNormalizer
