+    ha0 ha1 hW0 hW1 (Z^lxRat) (Z^lyRat) Z (HeckeZeroSupremum.beta+e) e
+    (Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hZ0 _) (Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hZ0 _) hZ0 ha (by linarith) (by linarith) he (by linarith)
